      "comment": "PAW CHRISTIE (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 22.21 beating Myrniong Storm. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. The hardest to beat again. MAD HATTER ROSE (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 435m behind Aston Rayner (24.61) in a Mix 3/4. Was in the money prior to that. Should be in this for a long way. TILLY GIRL (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Warragul in a handy 23.17 beating Boo Boo Giblet. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Bold showing expected again. QUEEN AVENGER (4) is worth a look over a shorter journey this time.",
